otal), showing off an additional puzzle mechanic, updated visuals, and more of the game's narrative.In the demo, you'll conjure wood bridges, use magical runes to jump across chasms, and traverse rickety bridges that collapse after cro","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T07:16:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706686259","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1375140-5410576585175522457","game_id":"steam-1375140","kind":"announcement","title":"2023 Review / 2024 Preview","summary":"Looking Back At 2023 Earlier in the year, our demo for The BridgeMaster was released on Steam, coinciding with its feature in the Steam Puzzle Fest! This got a lot more eyes on the game and produced more of your valuable feedback (more on that below). {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/40032706/f0aecc811dd22e53531612c0aeb41865bf662a89.jpg Then we were pleasantly surprised and very honored to be selected for the Seattle Indies Expo! We were among 25 games in the showcase, chosen from more than 50 that applied, s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-01-03T01:14:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5410576585175522457","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1375140-5141476355657957429","game_id":"steam-1375140","kind":"announcement","title":"Selected for the SIX Expo!","summary":"SIX 2023 We are very thrilled to share that we’ve been selected for the 2023 lineup of the Seattle Indies Expo! This weekend, we’ll be exhibiting The BridgeMaster at the Motif in Seattle for this free event on Sunday, September 3rd, from noon to 9pm. It’s just a short walk from the Seattle Convention Center if you happen to be there for PAX. We’d love to see you there! We’re definitely feeling very grateful to be selected! This year, 57 games applied to be part of the showcase, and after 300+ re","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2023-08-31T15:31:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5141476355657957429","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1375140-5151600576603855184","game_id":"steam-1375140","kind":"announcement","title":"Summer '23 Devlog","summary":"Hello friends & followers! This past month, we’ve had more happening with The BridgeMaster than we’ve had in a while! The game came out with an updated demo featured in the Steam Puzzle Fest, which got many new eyes on the game. And since then, we’ve made further updates to the demo, which you can now experience in the latest version today! {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/40032706/f0aecc811dd22e53531612c0aeb41865bf662a89.jpg Here are some of the changes we’ve made recently: Design Added the much requested “U","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2023-05-29T21:17:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5151600576603855184","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-1375140":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:27Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:27Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-1375140":"2026-10-26T09:51:27Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"1375140":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:27Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:27Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:27Z"},"2407220":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:27Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:27Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-